      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DEAN'S MAGIC (7) has a terrific record this track and trip with two wins and one placing from three starts. Hit the frame latest (18.31) when second at Richmond in a Grade 5. Looks the one to beat with even luck. FANCY PAY CHEQUE (1) missed the frame last time but had been racing well prior to that, winning a Grade 5 three back before a placing at this track the following run. Good beginner and aided by the inside draw. Can turn it around this time. RUBY TANUKI (4) filled a minor placing last start at The Gardens behind Rie Bale (23.36) in a Grade 5. Has the pace to be prominent. Winning chance. PARIS PARTY (8) drops in distance and should be in the mix.",
